  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Missed Again: Making space for partnerships in the Typhoon Haiyan response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This inter-agency project builds on the Missed Opportunities policy work which CAFOD has been involved in with 4 other NGOs which work through a partnership approach to humanitarian response. This research project examined the humanitarian response to Typhoon Haiyan and provided evidence of how the international humanitarian system aided and impeded partnership approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
